sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Flutter Client
    participant API as Flicko Go Monolith
    participant Auth as Supabase GoTrue Auth
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (users table)

    Note over User,DB: Registration Flow
    User->>API: POST /auth/register {email, pass, username}
    API->>Auth: Admin SDK Signup(email, pass)
    Auth-->>API: Returns {Auth User ID}
    API->>DB: INSERT INTO users {id(AuthID), username}
    DB-->>API: Success
    API->>Auth: Issue JWT
    Auth-->>API: Signed JWT Header
    API-->>User: 201 Created {Token}

    Note over User,DB: Authenticated API Request (RBAC)
    User->>API: POST /servers/123/channels {Bear Token}
    API->>API: Middleware: HMAC Verify Token & Expiry
    API->>API: Middleware: Extract UserID from Token
    API->>DB: ComputePermissions(UserID, Server123)
    DB-->>API: Returns Bitmask (e.g. 512)
    API->>API: Check if (512 & ManageChannels) == TRUE
    API->>DB: Execute Action (INSERT channel)
    DB-->>API: Returned new record
    API-->>User: 200 OK
